| id | status | severity | file | claim |
|----|--------|----------|------|-------|
| F4 | open | IMPORTANT | flutter_app/lib/services/aiin_connect_flow.dart | ⚠️ important the ain endpoint s vision verdict is session scoped on the app surface — it is lost at the next boot and the image attachment lock gh 2466 2 targets re locks this hunk correctly threads the endpoint s modalities verdict into the onboarding agentconfig — but the verdict lives only in the in memory config nothing persists it and nothing re derives it from the endpoint at boot lastconnection has no supportsimages field flutter app lib services last connection dart — the record carries only providerkind modelid baseurl preset ids so savefromconfig drops the verdict on the floor the boot restore re derives vision from the id heuristic boot config codec dart 96 98 — agentconfig supportsimages modelidsuggestsvision connection modelid nothing fetches models at boot endpointmodelscontroller inputmodalities populates only when the settings screen loads its list the restored heuristic only verdict gates image input agent service dart 659 661 config supportsimages modelidsuggestsvision → the main connection vision gate in video tool dart 193 198 no vision slot override ⇒ fromoverride false ⇒ the main model is checked session restore has the same gap agent service sessions dart 470 rebuilds with input inputmodalitiesfor sessionmodel modelid heuristic only net effect for the pr s flagship id connect with mistralai mistral large 4 0 endpoint reported text image → images work → restart the app → attach an image → the connected model does not accept images ticket ac 2 the image attachment ux unlocks for those models holds only within the session the cli does not have this gap its boot cache warm re fetches models so modelinputmodalities repopulates from the live endpoint every session fix persist the verdict — add supportsimages to lastconnection tojson fromjson fromconfig and have restore prefer the persisted verdict with the id heuristic as fallback supportsimages connection supportsimages modelidsuggestsvision connection modelid a boot time models re fetch would also close agent service sessions dart 470 but the persisted field is the minimal change the existing two connect flow widget tests cover the in session half a restore round trip assertion would cover the new field |

### How to answer

Add a `findingReview` block to `outputs/pr_review.json` (alongside `inlineComments`):

```json
{"findingReview": {
  "dispositions": [
    {"n": 1, "status": "fixed", "hunk": "<file:lines \u2014 the fixing hunk>"},
    {"n": 2, "status": "withdrawn", "reason": "<why this is not a defect>"},
    {"n": 3, "status": "re-introduced"}
  ],
  "confirmations": [
    {"proposedFor": 1, "same": true}
  ]
}}
```

Unconfirmed candidates become new identities (the merge bias is confirm-only); a genuinely new finding on a resolved item is expected to be raised again with new evidence.

